                            ><path
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                                d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h7"
                            ></path></svg
                        >
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <p
                            class="font-medium text-sm group-hover:text-apprenti-magenta transition-colors"
                        >
                            Curriculum structure basics
                        </p>
                        <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">
                            A curriculum is files: JSON metadata and Markdown
                            instructions, versioned in Git.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </a>
                <a
                    href="/docs/creator-authoring-with-apprenti-creator"
                    class="doc-card group flex items-center gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-border/50 bg-card/50 hover:shadow-md hover:border-apprenti-magenta/30 transition-all"
                    data-doc-title="Authoring with apprenti creator VS Code Cursor extension path"
                >
                    <div
                        class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-apprenti-magenta/10 flex items-center justify-center"
                    >
                        <svg
                            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                            class="h-5 w-5 text-apprenti-magenta"
                            fill="none"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            stroke-width="2"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            ><path
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                                d="M17.25 6.75 22.5 12l-5.25 5.25m-10.5 0L1.5 12l5.25-5.25m7.5-3-4.5 16.5"
                            ></path></svg
                        >
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <p
                            class="font-medium text-sm group-hover:text-apprenti-magenta transition-colors"
                        >
                            Authoring with apprenti creator
                        </p>
                        <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">
                            The VS Code / Cursor extension for building a path
                            visually.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </a>
                <a
                    href="/docs/creator-ai-policy"
                    class="doc-card group flex items-center gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-border/50 bg-card/50 hover:shadow-md hover:border-apprenti-magenta/30 transition-all"
                    data-doc-title="Setting the AI policy for a task disclosure"
                >
                    <div
                        class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-apprenti-magenta/10 flex items-center justify-center"
                    >
                        <svg
                            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                            class="h-5 w-5 text-apprenti-magenta"
                            fill="none"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            stroke-width="2"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            ><path
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                                d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0Z"
                            ></path></svg
