                        <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">
                            Decide what AI may do on each task, and when
                            disclosure is required.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </a>
                <a
                    href="/docs/creator-competencies-and-evidence"
                    class="doc-card group flex items-center gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-border/50 bg-card/50 hover:shadow-md hover:border-apprenti-magenta/30 transition-all"
                    data-doc-title="How competencies and evidence connect task resources acceptance criteria"
                >
                    <div
                        class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-apprenti-magenta/10 flex items-center justify-center"
                    >
                        <svg
                            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                            class="h-5 w-5 text-apprenti-magenta"
                            fill="none"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            stroke-width="2"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            ><path
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
