                            Which task fields point at which files, and how
                            they're meant to be used together.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </a>
                <a
                    href="/docs/creator-designing-competencies"
                    class="doc-card group flex items-center gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-border/50 bg-card/50 hover:shadow-md hover:border-apprenti-magenta/30 transition-all"
